   "where": "Table 2 caption",
   "quote": "Table 2: Prediction accuracy comparison among world models.",
   "note": "For metrics, EleF1 measures the similarity between the predicted TSM and the ground-truth TSM. We report EleF1 for five action categories and use Overall to denote the average value. Format Success measures the ratio of generated TSM outputs that can be successfully parsed. Each test set: 1,000 transitions, five action categories, 200 per category."
  },
